          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

CDIF Data Structure profile. Extends the Data Description profile with full DDI-CDI structural complexity: composing cdifDataStructure (DataStructure + Dimensional/Long/Wide variants), cdifDataStructureComponent (component subclasses), cdifRepresentedVariable, and cdifValueDomain. Distributions are expected to carry cdi:isStructuredBy pointing at a Data Structure node.
:title: "CDIF Data Structure metadata profile"
:prefix: ``cdif``
:noId:
:extends:
:noOwnSchema:</body>
